      "id": "app-get-startup-map",
      "name": "appGetStartupMap",
      "category": "UnrealEngine",
      "signature": "appGetStartupMap(Command Line)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Command Line",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "String",
      "docs": "This function will look at the given command line and see if we have passed in a map to load.\nIf we have then use that.\nIf we have not then use the DefaultMap which is stored in the Engine.ini\n@see UGameEngine::Init() for this method of getting the correct start up map\n@param CommandLine Commandline to use to get startup map (NULL or \"\" will return default startup map)\n@return Name of the startup map without an extension (so can be used as a package name)"
    },
